<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gulf South Medical.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gulf South Medical.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of Gulf South Medical Supply Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Gulf South Medical gained 3/8 to 20-1/2.</p>
